# The ability Evil Twin's exception adds is a copiable value (CR 707.9b; the ruling): Evil Twin is a copy of Bot2's Grizzly
# Bears with "{U}{B}, {T}: Destroy target creature with the same name as this creature", and Phyrexian Metamorph entering as a
# copy of that Twin is an artifact Guerrilla Gorilla with the ability as well. On turn 5 the Metamorph uses it on Bot2's Grizzly
# Bears.

